  "names": {
   "summary": "A 32-byte beacon frame in which only two monotonic counters could be identified. The u1 at offset 5 looks like a rolling frame or packet sequence number. The u3le at offset 14 looks like a longer uptime or message counter that resets occasionally. No sensor fields were located.",
